    "created_at": "2022-08-08T08:34:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-08-08T08:34:26Z",
    "body": "The test case here is for `location.href`, not `location.hash`. `location.hash = \"\"` behaves the same as `location.hash = \"#\"`.\r\n\r\nThis seems like an invalid report, as far as I can tell. Both the `hash` and `href` setter specs seem to match browsers.",
